Mount Settings -> MCP servers: its routes, and its Secret in every runner Pod.

omnigent_mcp_servers_api is this deployment's module, which the server image
installs next to omnigent_mcp_servers. Admin checks use the same sources as
/v1/me's is_admin, like the subscriptions routes. Every runner Pod's host
container gets the omnigent-mcp-servers Secret read-only at
/run/omnigent/mcp-servers; the volume is optional, so Pods start as before
until a server is saved, and Kubernetes updates the mount when one changes.
The agent wrappers read it (images/runner/mcp-servers.py).
Applies after 0018-binary-preview-gzip.patch. Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).

